// Proofs for the identities barista.hana states, in the strategy language of
// docs/proving.md. An identity with no entry here is proved by `diagram`
// alone — this file holds exactly the claims that need direction.

// Not a proof: a **standing case for the report**. Opening the calls is the
// one thing no closer does on its own, and doing only that leaves the
// corpus's biggest goal — 351 boxes against 2 — open and untouched by any
// rewrite. What `prove` prints here is the reference specimen of a proof in
// progress, and today it is 5,295 lines of which ~98% is stack routing the
// graph never had. Extending this to something that closes is a separate
// job from being able to watch it.
proof barista::customer_impl::emit_does_pre_and_post_is_constant = inline;
